id: ops-b2bs
title: Confirm the daily release commits the rebuilt dist/ before its pack check
description: "The resumed-release heading branch changed daily-release.ts (the calendar-day heading helpers) without rebuilding the tracked dist/ output, and merging main carried main's dist forward. No PR-branch gate enforces dist parity: CI and the quick release gate rebuild before running tests and never compare against the committed build. The daily-release workflow's 'Pack verified release' step enforces parity only on main's release candidate, via git diff --exit-code -- . and the dist/ porcelain check after the release's own release:check build, so the first daily release after this merge would fail there until dist is rebuilt and committed."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: "area:build","area:release"
created_at: "2026-11-17T08:17:21.282Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T07:42:41.509Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-17T08:19:43.995Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-17T08:19:43.995Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: pi-claude
repro_steps: "Merge a PR that changes daily-release.ts without rebuilding the tracked dist/, then run the next daily release."
resolution: Confirmed planner-order defect. Decide release imports the checked-out tools dist/daily-release.js before the candidate build. Prepare now rebuilds the trusted tools checkout and fails on tracked dist drift before loading the planner.
expected_result: "For the self-hosted reproduction, prepare rebuilds the trusted tools checkout at job.workflow_sha and fails on tracked dist/ drift in Verify trusted release tool build, before Decide release. Rebuild and commit dist/ on main before the next release. For a separate candidate repository with current trusted tools, the release rebuilds dist/, commits it in the release commit, and passes Pack verified release."
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T06:10:12.746Z",codex-sol,"Round BW: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64zDCl maps to 1e51801. The prepare job rebuilds and checks the trusted tools dist before installer and planner loading. The workflow ordering regression passed. The original completion, closure and creation timestamps are preserved."
  "2026-11-18T07:30:50.329Z",codex-sol,Verified the prepare workflow checks out the tools at job.workflow_sha and runs the tracked dist diff before installing the planner tools and deciding the release.
  "2026-11-18T07:42:41.508Z",codex-sol,The trusted planner build ordering fixture passed on the review head. The expected result now records the self-hosted drift failure and the separate candidate-repository outcome.
